+| Last persisted reconciliation health | 15:39:35.697023, ok=False, reason=checking_broker_books. Broker-position observations for your trade were not retained in that health payload. |
+
+Original code is preserved in `/home/ubuntu/backup-codex-manualstop-20261009T191938Z/`:
